          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Sow and Sprout"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The stelemora implants a seed inside a creature they're grappling. The target must attempt a DC 25 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Success:** The stelemora fails to implant a seed, and the target is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The target is sickened 1. While sickened, the target also takes 4d6 persistent piercing damage as flowering vines sprout through its flesh. The target can't end the persistent damage until it recovers from the sickened condition.\n- **Critical Failure:** As failure, except the target is sickened 2."
            },
